X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Money in vs out, month by month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/cashflow
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Detected recurring charges (needs ≥3 same-merchant charges at a steady rhythm)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/recurring
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Upcoming bills projected from recurring detection
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/bills/upcoming
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Debts with monthly interest cost
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debts
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Net-worth history (admin-only: aggregates private accounts too)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/net-worth/history
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

# ── Finance: statement imports (upload → extract → review → approve) ─────────

### 1. Upload the statement file (multipart; returns the file id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/files/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=NetworthyBoundary
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

--NetworthyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="statement.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

Date,Description,Amount
2026-07-01,COFFEE SHOP,-4.25
2026-07-02,PAYROLL,2500.00
--NetworthyBoundary--

### 2. Queue extraction (accountName optional — omit and the statement's own
###    account is detected, batch lands as needs-account if unknown)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

{ "fileId": "{{fileId}}", "accountName": "Chase Checking" }

### 3. Every batch not yet approved (file name, status, line count)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports/batches
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### One batch as the Review tab's drill-down document (lines + per-state actions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports/{{batchId}}/detail
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### A batch's extracted lines ("latest" = latest PARSED batch)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports/{{batchId}}/lines
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Recategorize one extracted line before approval (by zero-based index)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports/{{batchId}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

{ "index": 0, "category": "Dining" }

### Drop one extracted line before approval
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports/{{batchId}}/lines/0
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Attach an EXISTING account to a needs-account batch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports/{{batchId}}/assign-account
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

{ "accountName": "Chase Checking" }

### Or create the DETECTED account (institution + mask from the statement) and attach
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports/{{batchId}}/create-account
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Approve — post the batch's lines as transactions (the click IS the approval)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports/{{batchId}}/approve
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Discard an UNPOSTED batch (duplicate upload, abandoned import)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/imports/{{batchId}}/discard
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

# ── Finance: categories + settings ───────────────────────────────────────────

### The household's category taxonomy (starter set seeds on first run)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/categories
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Add/rename a category (id present = rename; parentName must exist)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/categories
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

{ "name": "Coffee", "parentName": "Dining" }

### Delete a category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/categories/{{categoryId}}
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Household settings (default currency, time zone, reminder cadences, thresholds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/settings
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Change them (currency = ISO code; timeZoneId = IANA id, blank = UTC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/settings
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

{ "defaultCurrencyCode": "MXN", "timeZoneId": "America/Mexico_City", "billReminderLeadDays": 3 }

### Saved exchange rates (multi-currency net worth combines through these —
### always user-chosen, never fetched)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/settings/rates
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Save one (units of the DEFAULT currency per 1 unit of the foreign one)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/settings/rates
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

{ "currencyCode": "USD", "rateToDefault": 18.7 }

### Delete one
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/settings/rates/USD
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}

### Which OCR engine would read a scanned statement right now, and why
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/settings/ocr
X-Dev-Subject: {{subject}}
X-Dev-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-Dev-Roles: {{roles}}
